/-!
# An extended local RV64 model

A superset of the 21-instruction arithmetic fragment with RV64I word forms,
the M extension, loads and stores, branches, `JAL`, `JALR` and `EBREAK`, an
exact 32-bit codec, and a PC-driven machine over `Process.Memory`. On base
instructions it agrees with `RiscV.step` (`Silmaril.RiscV.Ext.Retire`). Nothing here is
related to the generated Sail model (that correspondence needs the `riscv-zkvm` package,
which this repository does not include); it is a handwritten local model.
-/
